WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.377
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.476
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.471
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.975 --> 00:00:40.069
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.212 --> 00:00:43.045
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.383 --> 00:00:49.844
Ah, help me...my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.489 --> 00:00:56.621
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.529 --> 00:01:01.329
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.069 --> 00:01:08.870
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Alll want is

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.916
to see his smile

00:01:36.468 --> 00:01:38.766
K. TRAVEL

00:03:07.926 --> 00:03:15.799
NEW YORK TRAP —
"YUU, WAS | A FOOL?"

00:10:36.975 --> 00:10:39.102
MARMALADE BOY

00:10:45.717 --> 00:10:48.345
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.502 --> 00:22:12.469
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.325 --> 00:22:37.260
GOODBYE — "I CAN'T BE
YOUR GIRLFRIEND ANYMORE."

00:22:53.711 --> 00:22:58.239
I found the light

00:22:58.382 --> 00:23:03.615
That cleansed my heart

00:23:03.754 --> 00:23:08.350
In the awakening sky

00:23:08.492 --> 00:23:13.930
You shine

00:23:14.098 --> 00:23:19.035
Andl know

00:23:19.169 --> 00:23:24.129
No matter how far
apart we may be

00:23:24.275 --> 00:23:29.144
We're greeting
the same dawn

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:34.650
Aren't we?

00:23:34.785 --> 00:23:39.415
It's the brightly
glittering thread

00:23:39.556 --> 00:23:44.858
That binds our memories

00:23:44.995 --> 00:23:50.058
In the future beyond futures

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:55.228
The gods will be there for us

00:23:55.372 --> 00:24:01.641
The gods will be there for us
